1. A display apparatus comprising:  

a display panel; and  

a backlight unit disposed behind the display panel and configured to provide light to the display panel, the backlight unit comprising:  

a substrate having a front surface facing the display panel;  

a plurality of light emitting elements mounted on the front surface of the substrate;  

a reflective sheet disposed on the front surface of the substrate and including a plurality of openings through which the plurality of light emitting elements are respectively exposed;  

a plurality of partition walls provided on the reflective sheet and defining a plurality of light-emitting regions corresponding to the plurality of light emitting elements, each of the plurality of partition walls having an expanding shape in which a width of the partition wall increases in a direction away from the substrate; and  

a plurality of LED driver elements mounted on the front surface of the substrate and electrically connected to the plurality of light emitting elements to drive the plurality of light emitting elements.
